      "type": "∀ {κ : ℕ → Type u_1} [inst : (m : ℕ) → Fintype (κ m)] {V : Type u_2} {A : (m : ℕ) → Matrix (κ m) (κ m) ℝ}\n  (H : TfptCarrier.CofinalWeil.CofinalHypothesis A) (sample : (m : ℕ) → V → κ m → ℝ) (QW : V → ℝ),\n  (∀ (v : V), Filter.Tendsto (fun m => TfptCarrier.CofinalWeil.ladderForm A sample m v) Filter.atTop (𝓝 (QW v))) →\n    ∀ (v : V), 0 ≤ QW v"
    },
