      "type": "∀ {ι : Type u_1} [Fintype ι] (A : ℕ → Matrix ι ι ℝ) (C : ℝ),\n  (∀ (n : ℕ), (A n).PosSemidef) →\n    (∀ (n : ℕ) (i j : ι), |A n i j| ≤ C) →\n      ∃ G φ, StrictMono φ ∧ G.PosSemidef ∧ ∀ (i j : ι), Filter.Tendsto (fun n => A (φ n) i j) Filter.atTop (𝓝 (G i j))"
    },
